11	 * shares the new owner's {@link HouseholdNormalizer#id(String, String) household id} is the same
12	 * household, so the request is a household duplicate and is rejected with a 409 via
13	 * {@link DuplicateIdentityException}. Setting {@code sharesHousehold} acknowledges the shared
